      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Buffalo%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Buffalo and Northwestern Railroad arrived in town in May 1920 before the trackage was eventually abandoned in 1982.",
